Asteris Lux is a [[Phenomena/Hearts|Heart]] of [[Org/The Scale/index|The Scale]], kept at the order's forward base aboard the [[Org/The Harlequins/Providence|Providence]]. Its body is a concrete pillar with cracks running down it, and gold shows in the cracks, shifting and running as the Heart works, so that no two glances find the same pattern.

It speaks to other Scale hearts across the skein. An overseer can ask it to reach its fellows back at the stronghold for what the Scale knows, though [[Org/The Scale/People/Ralph Bishop|Bishop]] found the outpost's turning dish makes only a proximity sense and no line home of its own.
